{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePartwise\/credit","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"credit"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLCreditV","text":"MXLCredit","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCredit"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to nested MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"<credit>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" elements.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"credit","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL16MXLScorePartwiseV6creditSayAA9MXLCreditVGvp","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"credit"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLCreditV","text":"MXLCredit"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePartwise"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The credits — such as title, composer, and copyright notices — that appear on the first or following pages"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the score."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscorepartwise\/credit"]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLCredit":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLCredit"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The credit type represents the appearance of the title, composer, arranger, lyricist, copyright, dedication,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and other text, symbols, and graphics that commonly appear on the first page of a score. The credit-words,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credit-symbol, and credit-image elements are similar to the words, symbol, and image elements for directions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, since the credit is not part of a measure, the default-x and default-y attributes adjust the origin","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"relative to the bottom left-hand corner of the page. The enclosure for credit-words and credit-symbol is none","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by default.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLCredit","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCredit","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcredit","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLCredit"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLScorePartwise/credit":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscorepartwise\/credit","abstract":[{"text":"The credits — such as title, composer, and copyright notices — that appear on the first or following pages","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the score.","type":"text"}],"title":"credit","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePartwise\/credit","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"credit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLCredit","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLCreditV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLScorePartwise":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The score-partwise element is the root element for a partwise MusicXML score. It includes a score-header group"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"followed by a series of parts with measures inside. The document-attributes attribute group includes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"version attribute."}],"title":"MXLScorePartwise","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLScorePartwise"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLScorePartwise"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscorepartwise","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePartwise"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","type":"topic","role":"collection"}}}